{"title": "Ice Leviathan", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Ice Leviathan</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ice_Leviathan.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Ice Leviathan.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Ice_Leviathan.jpg/250px-Ice_Leviathan.jpg?24fad6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Ice_Leviathan.jpg/375px-Ice_Leviathan.jpg?24fad6 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ice_Leviathan.jpg/500px-Ice_Leviathan.jpg?24fad6 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nEarth Leviathan</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nIceLeviathan</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n2</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnknown</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nNo</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnkillable</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\nInstant Kill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\nIrrelevant</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\nImmune</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Ice Leviathan</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Earth_Leviathan\">Earth Leviathan</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. It is a brown, colossal, and long worm with a toothless and split jaw it opens to swallow things whole when feeding or defending its territory.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Similar to the Earth Leviathan, the <b>Ice Leviathan</b> is located underground and will roam around until a player above it is nearby. It will then chase that player, indicated by the rumbling of the <b>Ice Leviathan</b> below them. If the <b>Ice Leviathan</b> attempts to attack, the ground will start shaking and it will launch out of the ground into the sky at a random interval before crashing back down again. Any player or killable entity in the path of the <b>Ice Leviathan</b> when it attacks will die.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Chances\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Chances\">&gt; Spawn Chances</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Ice Leviathan</b> has an 18.33% chance to spawn in the interior and a 54.27% chance to spawn on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Glace\" title=\"Glace\"><b>Glace</b></a>. It additionally has a 20.50% chance to spawn on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Polarus\" title=\"Polarus\"><b>Polarus</b></a>, although <b>Ice Leviathans</b> also act as map hazards there.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Ice Leviathan <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">ICE LEVIATHAN<br /><br />Sigurd's danger level:&#160;??? idk I have n veer seen tehm<br /><br />Scientific name: Iciteren-gigantis<br /><br />The Ice leviathan, being part of the family Piscicolidae is, similarly to the Earth leviathan among the largest invertebrates in the Thistle Nebula. While there have been equally little recorded captures of this creature, there have been a lot of discoveries made since the expedition in the glacial caves of 94-Polarus, which they have made their home.<br /><br />While it is often assumed that these leviathans primarily hunt land-dwelling prey due to their occasional appearances above the earth. It is quite the opposite.<br />Their jaws do not have any teeth but instead have baleen which they use to filter out nutrients from vast frozen oceans.<br />It is only in desperate times when they resort to hunting for prey on land. However they might also appear when their breeding grounds are threatened. Be wary of sudden vibrations as you might not immediately realise you are walking above one.<br /><br />Ice leviathans primarily burrow themselves within deep sheets of ice, carving out large sections creating these ginormous unnatural caverns as resting and breeding places in between feeding sessions. Using their extremely hard and thick skin to break through the ice. <br />They have to move often due to the nutrient supply not replenishing quick enough to sustain the leviathan.<br />An ice leviathan will only ever make one breeding cavern in their lifetime, it is often much larger than resting caverns and it is always the place they return to when mortally wounded, or when they are approaching the final months of their life. They will stay there until death occurs. It is not known why. The common theory is that Ice Leviathans share a sentimental value with the area where they birthed their young.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Burrowing</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"7\" data-mwtitle=\"BurrowingRumble1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/BurrowingRumble1.mp3?18b302\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/BurrowingRumble1.mp3/BurrowingRumble1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"BurrowingRumble2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/BurrowingRumble2.mp3?1935f5\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/BurrowingRumble2.mp3/BurrowingRumble2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"5\" data-mwtitle=\"BurrowingRumble3.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/BurrowingRumble3.mp3?a360da\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/BurrowingRumble3.mp3/BurrowingRumble3.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>About to Emerge</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"BurrowingRumbleLoud1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/BurrowingRumbleLoud1.mp3?4f6a1b\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/BurrowingRumbleLoud1.mp3/BurrowingRumbleLoud1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Emerging</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"9\" data-mwtitle=\"WormEmerge.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/WormEmerge.mp3?5fe49a\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/WormEmerge.mp3/WormEmerge.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Roaring</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"5\" data-mwtitle=\"IcewormRoar.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/IcewormRoar.mp3?800ca9\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/IcewormRoar.mp3/IcewormRoar.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"6\" data-mwtitle=\"IcewormRoar2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/IcewormRoar2.mp3?58445d\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/IcewormRoar2.mp3/IcewormRoar2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Landing</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"9\" data-mwtitle=\"IceWormLand.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/IceWormLand.mp3?94f0a6\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/IceWormLand.mp3/IceWormLand.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:IceLeviathanSky.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"An Ice Leviathan seen in the sky from a distance.\"><img alt=\"An Ice Leviathan seen in the sky from a distance.\" src=\"/images/thumb/IceLeviathanSky.jpg/120px-IceLeviathanSky.jpg?c6371f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/IceLeviathanSky.jpg/180px-IceLeviathanSky.jpg?c6371f 1.5x, /images/thumb/IceLeviathanSky.jpg/240px-IceLeviathanSky.jpg?c6371f 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">An Ice Leviathan seen in the sky from a distance.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul></div>", "images": ["Ice_Leviathan.jpg", "IceLeviathanSky.jpg", "BurrowingRumble1.mp3", "BurrowingRumble2.mp3", "BurrowingRumble3.mp3", "BurrowingRumbleLoud1.mp3", "WormEmerge.mp3", "IcewormRoar.mp3", "IcewormRoar2.mp3", "IceWormLand.mp3"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes"]}